<Defs>

<!-- 突袭作战裙甲  -->
	<ThingDef Class="NewRatkin.CustomThingDef" ParentName="OARatkin_ArmorMakeableBase">
		<defName>OA_RK_New_Windbreaker_E</defName>
		<label>Assault Combat Skirt Armor</label>
		<description>The light armor developed by the Golden Iris Empire for raid teams in highly turbulent areas provides more reliable protection compared to windbreakers. \n\nThe armor is equipped with high-strength specially made lightweight armor plates in the main parts, which can protect the firepower of small caliber firearms, and the parts without attached armor plates are also made of specialized dense fibers. \nIn addition, the armor is equipped with two disposable grenade launchers, which perform particularly well in small-scale high-intensity combat environments.</description>
		<graphicData>
			<texPath>Apparel/OA_RK_New_Windbreaker_E</texPath>
			<graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
			<shaderType>CutoutComplex</shaderType>
		</graphicData>
		<costList>
			<Synthread>85</Synthread>
			<Uranium>90</Uranium>
			<ComponentIndustrial>8</ComponentIndustrial>
			<ComponentSpacer>1</ComponentSpacer>
		</costList>
		<techLevel>Spacer</techLevel>
		<statBases>
			<MaxHitPoints>440</MaxHitPoints>
			<WorkToMake>52600</WorkToMake>
			<Mass>5.2</Mass>
			<ArmorRating_Sharp>0.975</ArmorRating_Sharp>
			<ArmorRating_Blunt>0.57</ArmorRating_Blunt>
			<ArmorRating_Heat>1.18</ArmorRating_Heat>
			<Insulation_Cold>26</Insulation_Cold>
			<Insulation_Heat>20</Insulation_Heat>
			<EquipDelay>4.5</EquipDelay>
		</statBases>
		<equippedStatOffsets>
			<Flammability>-0.80</Flammability>
			<MoveSpeed>0.1</MoveSpeed>
			<StaggerDurationFactor MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech">-0.5</StaggerDurationFactor>
		</equippedStatOffsets>
		<comps>
			<li Class="CompProperties_ApparelReloadable">
				<maxCharges>2</maxCharges>
				<ammoDef>OA_RK_TurretGun_Bullet</ammoDef>
				<ammoCountPerCharge>1</ammoCountPerCharge>
				<baseReloadTicks>90</baseReloadTicks>
				<soundReload>Standard_Reload</soundReload>
				<hotKey>Misc4</hotKey>
				<chargeNoun>火箭榴弹</chargeNoun>
				<displayGizmoWhileUndrafted>false</displayGizmoWhileUndrafted>
			</li>
		</comps>
		<verbs>
			<li>
				<label>使用火箭榴弹发射器</label>
				<verbClass>Verb_LaunchProjectileStatic</verbClass>
				<hasStandardCommand>true</hasStandardCommand>
				<onlyManualCast>True</onlyManualCast>
				<range>27.9</range>
				<forcedMissRadius>1.4</forcedMissRadius>
				<warmupTime>0.6</warmupTime>
				<noiseRadius>4</noiseRadius>
				<ai_IsBuildingDestroyer>true</ai_IsBuildingDestroyer>
				<soundCast>Shot_IncendiaryLauncher</soundCast>
				<soundCastTail>GunTail_Medium</soundCastTail>
				<muzzleFlashScale>14</muzzleFlashScale>
				<drawHighlightWithLineOfSight>true</drawHighlightWithLineOfSight>
				<targetParams>
					<canTargetLocations>true</canTargetLocations>
				</targetParams>
				<defaultProjectile>OA_RK_Turret_Bullet_A</defaultProjectile>
				<rangedFireRulepack>Combat_RangedFire_Thrown</rangedFireRulepack>
			</li>
		</verbs>
		<apparel>
			<bodyPartGroups>
				<li>Torso</li>
				<li>Neck</li>
				<li>Shoulders</li>
				<li>Arms</li>
				<li>Legs</li>
				<li>Feet</li>
			</bodyPartGroups>
			<drawData>
				<defaultData>
					<layer>30</layer>
				</defaultData>
			</drawData>
			<wornGraphicPath>Apparel/OA_RK_New_Windbreaker_E</wornGraphicPath>
			<layers>
				<li>Shell</li>
			</layers>
		</apparel>
		<recipeMaker>
			<skillRequirements>
				<Crafting>15</Crafting>
			</skillRequirements>
			<useIngredientsForColor>false</useIngredientsForColor>
			<unfinishedThingDef>UnfinishedTechArmor</unfinishedThingDef>
			<researchPrerequisite>OA_RK_Apparel_C</researchPrerequisite>
		</recipeMaker>
	</ThingDef>

    <!-- 重装突袭作战护甲  -->
	<ThingDef Class="NewRatkin.CustomThingDef" ParentName="OARatkin_ArmorMakeableBase">
		<defName>OA_RK_New_Windbreaker_FangzhiBUGdehouzhui_ACC</defName>
		<label>Heavy assault armor</label>
		<description>After adopting advanced military concepts and power armor culture from the Milky Way, the Golden Iris Empire combined its own technology to develop cutting-edge individual armor. \nThe armor is designed with a complex sensing circuit inside, greatly reducing the wearable load, while the multi-layer impact reduction structure in the interlayer and the design of the dense armor attached have excellent firepower resistance. Even the bombardment of small caliber artillery may not cause serious damage to the wearer. In addition, the armor also incorporates the ultimate fabric produced by the cutting-edge textile technology of the Golden Iris Orchid, which further enhances its already excellent protection and gives it excellent toughness. \nHowever, the only drawback is that due to the complexity of the armor process and the fact that most of the required fabrics are cutting-edge products, as well as the immaturity of the corresponding production lines, even the Golden Iris Empire has not yet been able to carry out standardized assembly, and has only been allocated for raid teams in highly turbulent areas. \n\nThanks to the exquisite textile craftsmanship, uranium craftsmanship, and clothing design art of the Golden Iris Orchid, this armor has extremely superior protection and can evenly distribute the impact pressure, greatly reducing the impact force. When equipping, multiply the damage coefficient by 75%. \nThe cloak on the armor is woven from the ultimate fabric of the golden iris orchid, which can greatly weaken the shock wave generated by explosions in the microstructure and reduce the damage received by explosions by 25%. \nFinally, for groundbreaking considerations, the armor is also equipped with two disposable grenade launchers, making it particularly outstanding in small-scale high-intensity combat environments.</description>
		<graphicData>
			<texPath>Apparel/OA_RK_New_Windbreaker_F_A</texPath>
			<graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
			<shaderType>CutoutComplex</shaderType>
		</graphicData>
		<costList>
