    <!-- 全防护突袭装甲  -->
	<ThingDef Class="NewRatkin.CustomThingDef" ParentName="OARatkin_ArmorMakeableBase">
		<defName>OA_RK_New_Windbreaker_G</defName>
		<label>Full protective assault armor</label>
		<description>The Golden Iris Empire imitated and produced products after its first exposure to the power armor culture of the Milky Way. \nThe protection of this armor is almost unquestionable, but the cost is that its wearable load is almost unaffordable. Due to the overly one-sided emphasis on protection, the weight of this armor has reached an astonishing level, and the simple neural sensing network is completely unable to bear this weight, resulting in a significant decrease in mobility when worn. \nHowever, apart from the extremely poor wearing experience, this armor can almost be called an unstoppable tower on the battlefield. \n\nThanks to the thick armor plate and built-in impact reduction design, the wear resistance coefficient is reduced to 70%. \nThanks to the thick armor plate, there will be a small amount of emotional punishment when wearing it.</description>
